abstract: >-
  Reproducible software and research artifacts for comparing uncontrolled EV
  charging, carbon-aware smart charging, and mobility-constrained bidirectional
  vehicle-to-grid scheduling under operational, infrastructure, participation,
  forecast-error, and battery-degradation uncertainty.
keywords:
